To avoid a repeat I suggest a short checklist for every reefer import to Feli=
xstowe. Draft attached.

Key point: Harbour Agency checks the commodity code against the invoice and p=
acking list before the vessel arrives, not after. Proposal is at least 2 work=
ing days before ETA. If the code and the description don't match, Harbour cal=
ls me and we clear it with the supplier first.

Oliver, can you confirm this works on your side? Harbour, can you confirm you=
 can do this check?

Regards,
